		(property "Description" "Low-band (698-960 MHz) tuning pad chain for the KYOCERA AVX P822601 antenna, copied from the P822601-01 demo board (bottom side). Pad 6 goes to antenna pin 4 through a via; pads 3-4, 4-5 and 5-6 are bridged by copper (net tie). Fit 0R 0402 across open gaps to lower the resonance, cut bridges to raise it."
